# 统一换行符：仓库里存 LF，检出也保持 LF，避免 Windows 上反复出现「整文件都变了」的假 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 代码与文本资源统一按文本处理，diff 才看得懂
*.cs       text diff=csharp
*.shader   text
*.md       text
*.json     text
*.yml      text
*.unity    text
*.prefab   text
*.asset    text
*.mat      text
*.meta     text

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换、不做文本 diff
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.ttf      binary
*.otf      binary
*.ogg      binary
*.wav      binary
*.dll      binary
*.exe      binary
